with emphasis on the Middle Ages (11th to 16th centuries). The exhibition on the Viking Age was expanded in 2021. In the Gold Room, you'll find gold treasures from the…"],["Economy Museum – Royal Coin Cabinet","sight",59.33471,18.09094,"Narvavägen 13-17","Tue-Sun 11:00-17:00, Summer: 11:00-18:00","","","","r","Based on a Royal coin collection, this museum tells the story of money, wealth and financial management."],["Army Museum","sight",59.3347,18.0803,"Riddargatan 13","10:00-17:00","","","","r","Displays the history of war, focused on the rise and fall of the Swedish Empire during the 16th to 18th centuries, followed by Sweden's role in the shade of World War I, World War II in Europe and Cold War Europe. The museum makes a…"],["Berwaldhallen","sight",59.33297,18.09944,"Dag Hammarskjölds väg 3","","","","","r","The official concert hall for the Swedish Radio Symphony Orchestra."],["Environmental obelisks","sight",59.33135,18.08081,"","","","","","r","Since 1994, these obelisks provide a live bar chart of pollution and other parameters for air and water in Stockholm."],["Magic Bar","activity",59.33703,18.08918,"Karlaplan 6","","","","","r","This restaurant brands itself as Europe's only stage dedicated to the art of illusion. Close-up magic on weekday nights, stage shows on weekends."],["Gastrologik","restaurant",59.3338,18.08109,"Artillerigatan 14","","","","","r","While lunches are 135&nbsp;kr, dining menus are costly. One Guide Michelin star."],["Museum of Modern Art","sight",59.32636,18.08395,"Slupskjulsvägen 7-9","Tue 10:00-20:00, Wed-Sun 10:00-18:00","","","","r","Stockholm's museum of modern art is headed by Lars Nittve, formerly of London's Tate Modern. These museums have several works by famous artists - Pablo Picasso, Henri Matisse, Salvador Dalí and Irving Penn, an American photographer.…"],["ArkDes - Swedish Centre for Architecture and Design","sight",59.32572,18.08526,"","Tue 10:00-20:00, Wed-Sun 10:00-18:00","","","","r","Exhibits and models including the annual gingerbread house competition. Cafe with good views outside."],["East Asian Museum","sight",59.32736,18.08174,"Tyghusplan","Tue 11:00-20:00, Wed-Sun 11:00-17:00","","","","r","Displays ancient, classical and contemporary East Asian culture."],["The Royal University College of Fine Arts","sight",59.32429,18.08309,"Flaggmansvägen 1","","","","","r","Recommended by Wikivoyage"],["Fotografins hus","sight",59.3276,18.083,"Slupskjulsvägen 26 c","","","","","r","A gallery of contemporary photography."],["Skeppsholmen's quay","sight",59.3272,18.0805,"","","","","","r","Several heritage ships, with information plaques."],["Eric Ericsonhallen","activity",59.3264,18.08247,"","","","","","r","Formerly a naval church, this is today a concert hall, mainly used by the many choirs in Stockholm."],["Vasa Museum","sight",59.32807,18.09139,"Galärvarvsvägen 14","Jun–Aug: daily 08:30–18:00, Sep-May: 10:00–17:00 (Wed 10:00-20:00)","","","","r","This museum displays the Vasa, an original warship built for the Thirty Years War which sank in Stockholm Harbour on its maiden voyage in 1628, during the heyday of the Swedish Empire. Salvaged in 1961, the ship is almost wholly…"],["Abba The Museum","sight",59.32505,18.09683,"Djurgårdsvägen 68","Mid-Jan to May, Sep to mid-Dec: Mon Tue Fri-Sun 10:00-18:00, Wed Thu 10:00-20:00; Jun to Aug: daily 09:00-20:00; 10:00-18:00; mid-Dec to Dec 21: daily 10:00-18:","","","","r","A museum of the Swedish pop band ABBA: their spectacular costumes, gold records and original items. In the same building you’ll find Pop House Hotel with 49 stylishly decorated hotel rooms and Pop House Hotel Food & Bar. It has a gift shop."],["The Viking Museum","sight",59.32656,18.09477,"Djurgårdsvägen 48","","","","","r","A Viking museum opened in 2017. The main attraction is Ragnfrids saga, an 11-minute ride through dioramas depicting a Viking adventure. The ride is a bit scary; children should be at least 7 years old, and accompanied by an adult. There…"],["Biological Museum","sight",59.32713,18.0977,"Hazeliusporten 2","","","","","r","Scandinavian and Arctic dioramas with stuffed Scandinavian animals, lit only by daylight (limiting the opening hours; the museum closes at 15:00 in October-March, and 16:00 in April-September). When built in 1893, the diorama technique…"],["Spirits Museum","sight",59.3271,18.09389,"Djurgårdsvägen 38","","","","","r","Displays the history of alcoholic beverages in Sweden with heavy drinking, heavy government control, and heavy taxation. The museum also contains the Absolut Art Collection, containing advertising for Absolut Vodka by Andy Warhol, Keith…"],["Galärvarvskyrkogården","sight",59.32803,18.09366,"","","","","","r","Contains the memorial of the M/S Estonia (a Baltic Sea cruise ferry lost in 1994), as well as graves of prominent Swedes such as Stikkan Anderson (co-founder of ABBA, and founder of the Polar Music Award)."],["Friends of Handicraft","sight",59.32352,18.09995,"Djurgårdsslätten 82–84","","","","","r","A handicraft studio."],["Liljevalchs","sight",59.32553,18.09618,"Djurgårdsvägen 60","","","","","r","A contemporary art hall, in business since 1916."],["Cirkus","activity",59.3249,18.09989,"","","","","","r","Among Stockholm's largest playhouses, with 1,650 seats. Features musicals and pop concerts."],["Blå Porten [bloːˈpuʈən]","restaurant",59.3252,18.09644,"Djurgårdsvägen 64","Mon-Fri 11:00-23:00, Sat Sun 11:00-19:00","","","","r","Blå porten, hidden in the back yard of Liljevalchs konsthall, is the one exception. Delicious food in a lush garden makes the long queues worth it. The excellent cakes and pies also makes this a good choice for a coffee break."],["Sjöcaféet","restaurant",59.33057,18.09349,"Galärvarvsvägen 2","","","","","r","In the same building as the visitor center, with indoor and outdoor seating."]]}